msgstr "Générer les couleurs du thème à partir de la pochette de l'album."

# Color Style chip labels (Material 3 dynamic-colour scheme variants). Order
# must match `services::material_you::SchemeStyle::all()` — "None" already
# translated above; remaining 7 below. Source: Tauri's `settings.ts` (de),
# kept verbatim so users moving between the apps see consistent vocabulary.

